@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+"tauri": patch
+---
+
+Use [`Url.join()`](https://docs.rs/url/2.2.2/url/struct.Url.html#method.join) when building webview URLs in
+`WindowManager`, to handle edge cases and leading/trailing slashes in paths and urls.
